OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G0130FEras: Phil Collins
OL,5,     GBruised by the tabloids, Phil
OL,6,     GCollins begins his gradual
OL,7,     Gretreat from show business. But
OL,8,     Gretirement is easier said than
OL,9,     Gdone for the hardest-working man
OL,10,     Gin pop.
OL,11,G0200FDance Sounds of the 90s with
OL,12,     FVernon Kay
OL,13,     GYour name is on the guest list so
OL,14,     Gjoin Vernon Kay for an hour of
OL,15,     Gpure club floorfillers!
OL,16,G0300FRadio 2's Piano Room
OL,17,     GCeleste performs This Is Who I
OL,18,     GAm, her theme written for 'The
OL,19,     GDay of the Jackal', and covers
OL,20,     GLabi Siffre's classic Bless The
OL,21,     GTelephone along with her
OL,22,     Gbreakthrough hit, Strange.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
